WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.583
Read the draft question: Why are you afraid to charge what you deserve, and will you buy my coaching today?

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:13.895
It assumes an emotional problem and pressures a purchase.

00:00:13.895 --> 00:00:23.477
Replace it with: Which supplied input would you check before using this draft, and what next step fits your situation?

00:00:23.477 --> 00:00:27.789
This invites a practical choice without claiming personal expertise.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:34.976
Use the reflective guidance cycle only where helpful: Clarify, Explore, Examine, Choose, Act and Review.

00:00:34.976 --> 00:00:39.767
Select a relevant step; do not duplicate a general worksheet.

00:00:39.767 --> 00:00:43.600
Explain how the revision improves voice and agency.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.954
Teaching still needs explanation and usable practice.

00:00:46.954 --> 00:00:51.746
Coaching-style reflection does not authorize diagnosis, therapy or licensed advice.

00:00:51.746 --> 00:00:57.495
Retain any need for qualified authority and keep the saved service boundary.
